silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_shared_diagram_concrete_anchor#readerview silm:hasLongDescription "The ReaderView is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{ReaderView} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
