silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_04_shared_diagram_concrete_anchor#auditview silm:hasLongDescription "The AuditView is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{AuditView}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
